Transitional package for the renamed Kazuha Hub Wi-Fi proxy.

The site-side Wi-Fi authentication proxy is now os-kazuhahub-wifi-proxy, which
this package depends on so that an ordinary firmware update installs it. The
new package takes over the saved settings unchanged; this one removes what the
former service left behind and starts the renamed service. It can be removed
once the router runs os-kazuhahub-wifi-proxy.
